OL,3,GNEWSAJury sworn in for teenage girl
OL,4,Arape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury has been sworn in for the
OL,7,Ftrial of two men and four teenage boys
OL,8,Fover the alleged rape of a teenage girl
OL,9,Fin Kent.
OL,11,FKent Police received reports on 21
OL,12,FApril that a girl had been raped at a
OL,13,Fprivate property in Salisbury Road,
OL,14,FGravesend, between 25 March and 19
OL,15,FApril.
OL,17,FIonut Dobre, 33, of Cleanthus Road,
OL,18,FWoolwich, is charged with rape
OL,19,Falongside three 16-year-olds and a
OL,20,F15-year-old, all from Gravesend.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
