OL,3,GNEWSAJury sworn in for teenage girl
OL,4,Arape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FBenone Inofte, 46, of Salisbury Road,
OL,7,FGravesend, is charged with facilitating
OL,8,Fthe sexual exploitation of a child. All
OL,9,Fthe defendants, who appeared at
OL,10,FWoolwich Crown Court on Monday, have
OL,11,Fpleaded not guilty to the charges.
